1 | general | Goal: restore the battlefield as it appeared in July 1863 | R12.043 | ~park goal (modern) | stated | The page states the park's natural resource goal to restore and perpetuate the battlefield as it appeared at the time of the battle in July 1863 and to preserve compatible fauna and flora | to (1) restore and perpetuate the battlefield as it appeared at the time of the Battle of Gettysburg in July 1863
@ NPSGOV-GRASSLANDS
1 | general | Before the war: working farms, meadows and woodlots | - | pre-1863 | stated | The page says that before the Civil War the Gettysburg landscape was defined by working farms, meadows and woodlots | Before the Civil War, the Gettysburg landscape was defined by working farms, meadows, and woodlots.
