1 | buildings | Warfield farmhouse: porch and single door (hedged) | bld-warfield-house | 1863-07 | hedged | Schematic drawings show the roof extending past the east stone wall to form a porch and the evidence suggests the east door was the only door | The roof slope extended past the stone walls at the east side to form a porch. >>> only door to the house.
